# Cursor operating protocol

**LIVE_MODULAR_PUBLISHING_ENABLED.** Read `.dentcast/workflows/global/README.md` and all three active global files, plus the complete `.dentcast/workflows/agent-parity.md`. They govern conversation, approvals, capability failures, Git, builders and final verification. Legacy files are backup only; do not read them for execution.
New publication follows `.dentcast/workflows/README.md` and the applicable full modules. Staging receipts never replace scientific execution or founder consent.

## Interrupted publication

For «انتشار ناقص داشتم», «ادامه انتشار», "resume publishing", or equivalent, first read `.dentcast/PUBLISH-HANDOFF.md`, then `.dentcast/workflows/publish-handoff.md`. Check the same fixed path before a new publication. Never overwrite unfinished work. Update it after every canonical step and before handing off; delete it only after verified completion. A missing file or unavailable work must be reported, not invented. Local commits and dirty files are not automatically available in another checkout.
